 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one objectively “best” title company, but **Palm Title** looks like a strong first call for a typical Fort Lauderdale home closing: it has a downtown office, handles residential purchases and sales, and its published client testimonials emphasize communication and smooth closings.\n\nI’d also compare **Title Partners of South Florida** and **Independent Title of Fort Lauderdale**. Before choosing, ask each for a written estimate of title, settlement, and other fees; who will handle your file; how they’ll communicate updates; and whether they can meet your closing date. Check that the company is acceptable to your lender, too. In Florida, the purchase contract may specify who selects the closing agent, so review that provision before hiring one.",
